OL,3,AMet chief says he wouldn't be surprised
OL,4,Aif more allegations made about Brand
OL,5,Aafter rape conviction
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe was acquitted of two other rape
OL,8,Fcharges and one allegation of attempted
OL,9,Findecent assault. The 51-year-old will
OL,10,Fbe sentenced on Monday.
